(globalThis.TURBOPACK||(globalThis.TURBOPACK=[])).push(["object"==typeof document?document.currentScript:void 0,33499,e=>{"use strict";var n=e.i(43476),a=e.i(71645);let i={en:{},tr:{Work:"Çalışmalar","Life as a game":"Bir oyun olarak hayatım","Case studies":"Vaka çalışmaları",Notes:"Notlar",About:"Hakkımda",Contact:"İletişim",Sections:"Bölümler","Open menu":"Menüyü aç","Close menu":"Menüyü kapat",Munich:"Münih",Email:"E-posta",Privacy:"Gizlilik","Sustainability and economics, studied in parallel at the Technical University of Munich and Istanbul University. Internships and project work in ESG and consulting since 2024, and a body of open source instruments for carbon accounting and financial analysis, each published open with its method and its limits stated.":"Münih Teknik Üniversitesi ve İstanbul Üniversitesi'nde paralel okunan sürdürülebilirlik ve iktisat. 2024'ten bu yana ESG ve danışmanlık alanında stajlar ve proje çalışmaları, ve karbon muhasebesi ile finansal analiz için açık kaynak araçlar; her biri yöntemi ve sınırları yazılı olarak yayımlanmış.","Munich, Germany":"Münih, Almanya","Technical University of Munich and Istanbul University":"Münih Teknik Üniversitesi ve İstanbul Üniversitesi","Verified work":"Doğrulanmış çalışma","Every tool below is open and shows its working. Three produce a figure a professional signs off, and each states on the result that it does not guarantee it.":"Aşağıdaki her araç açıktır ve hesabını gösterir. Üçü, bir uzmanın imzaladığı bir sayı üretir ve her biri sonucun üzerinde o sayıyı garanti etmediğini yazar.","test assertions":"test doğrulaması","worked by hand, not read back from the code":"elle yazıldı, koddan geri okunmadı","finished tools":"bitmiş araç","across trades with nothing in common":"birbirinden uzak mesleklerde","case studies":"vaka çalışması","method, assumptions and limits stated":"yöntem, varsayım ve sınırlar yazılı",instruments:"enstrüman","in the browser, no account required":"tarayıcıda, hesap gerekmez","ESG and finance instruments":"ESG ve finans enstrümanları","Seventeen finished tools":"On yedi bitmiş araç","Finished tools across unrelated trades, from braille transcription to earthworks, held up by 870 hand worked test assertions.":"Braille çevirisinden hafriyata, birbirinden uzak mesleklerde bitmiş araçlar; elle yazılmış 870 test doğrulamasıyla ayakta.","My life as a game":"Bir oyun olarak hayatım","Play the film":"Filmi oynat","What is inside it":"İçinde ne var","How it is built":"Nasıl yapıldı","Where it lives":"Nerede yaşıyor","Experience and education":"Deneyim ve eğitim","Seven roles across ESG, consulting, market entry and marketing, two degrees read in parallel, and the work permit.":"ESG, danışmanlık, pazara giriş ve pazarlama alanında yedi görev, paralel okunan iki lisans ve çalışma izni.","Eight written studies, each stating the problem, the method, and what the instrument refuses to do.":"Sekiz yazılı çalışma; her biri problemi, yöntemi ve enstrümanın yapmayı reddettiği şeyi belirtir.","Available for working student and internship positions.":"Werkstudent ve staj pozisyonlarına açığım.","Whether an importer crosses the 50 tonne de minimis threshold, and what the certificates cost.":"Bir ithalatçının 50 tonluk de minimis eşiğini aşıp aşmadığı ve sertifikaların maliyeti.","Emissions traced through a precursor chain, the attribution reconciling to zero.":"Öncül zinciri boyunca izlenen emisyonlar; dağıtım sıfıra denkleşiyor.","A reduction target and the cumulative carbon budget it implies, not just its endpoint.":"Bir azaltım hedefi ve onun ima ettiği kümülatif karbon bütçesi; yalnızca varış noktası değil.","A cited emission factor that carries its source, and refuses a naive timestamp.":"Kaynağını taşıyan, atıflı bir emisyon katsayısı; naif zaman damgasını reddeder.","A discounted cash flow that prints its terminal share, and a market sized both ways at once.":"Nihai değer payını basan bir indirgenmiş nakit akışı ve aynı anda iki yönden boyutlandırılmış bir pazar.","CBAM screening, embedded emissions, reduction pathways, data provenance and valuation. Each runs in the browser and stores nothing.":"CBAM taraması, gömülü emisyonlar, azaltım patikaları, veri kökeni ve değerleme. Her biri tarayıcıda çalışır ve hiçbir şey saklamaz.","Schelling segregation, network contagion, traffic jam formation, self organised criticality and recommender feedback.":"Schelling ayrışması, ağ üzerinden bulaşma, trafik tıkanıklığının oluşumu, kendiliğinden örgütlenen kritiklik ve öneri geri beslemesi.","Adverse selection, tax incidence, discounting and repeated cooperation, each with a working model in the page.":"Ters seçim, vergi yansıması, iskonto ve yinelenen işbirliği; her birinin sayfasında çalışan bir model var.","Six small games that are played rather than read.":"Okunmak yerine oynanan altı küçük oyun.","Thirty seven published pieces":"Otuz yedi yayımlanmış parça","Everything here runs on this site. Nothing needs an account, nothing stores data, and every figure is checkable by opening the thing that produced it.":"Buradaki her şey bu sitede çalışır. Hiçbiri hesap istemez, hiçbiri veri saklamaz ve her sayı, onu üreten şeyi açarak kontrol edilebilir.",pieces:"parça","Finished tools":"Bitmiş araçlar","Agent based simulations":"Etmen tabanlı simülasyonlar","Explorable essays":"Keşfedilebilir denemeler","Game theory":"Oyun kuramı","Seven roles, two degrees in progress":"Yedi görev, devam eden iki lisans","Every role and every degree, in the order they happened, with the languages and the residence permit that frame where the work can happen.":"Her görev ve her öğrenim, gerçekleştiği sırayla; işin nerede yapılabileceğini belirleyen diller ve oturma izniyle birlikte.",Experience:"Deneyim","Education, languages, permit":"Eğitim, diller, izin",Languages:"Diller","Work permit":"Çalışma izni","Available for working student and internship positions in Munich. Every message is read.":"Münih'te Werkstudent ve staj pozisyonlarına açığım. Her mesaj okunur.","Research notes on agency under algorithmic influence and on why a deterministic world still yields no forecast.":"Algoritmik etki altında eyleyicilik üzerine ve determinist bir dünyanın neden yine de öngörü vermediği üzerine araştırma notları.","Eight written case studies, each stating the problem, the method, and what the instrument refuses to do.":"Sekiz yazılı vaka çalışması; her biri problemi, yöntemi ve enstrümanın yapmayı reddettiği şeyi belirtir.","Interactive · three languages":"Etkileşimli · üç dil","A hand drawn scroll film of one year in the life of a tree, with a museum buried under its roots and two cities either side. No images, no video: everything drawn line by line while you watch.":"Bir ağacın bir yılını anlatan, elle çizilmiş kaydırmalı bir film; köklerinin altına gömülü bir müze ve iki yanında iki şehir. Görsel yok, video yok: her şey siz izlerken çizgi çizgi çiziliyor.","Scrolling down runs a year: summer, the turn, the fall, dusk, and then the camera goes underground to the roots and the doors. The film is scrubbed rather than played. Every leaf's flight is calculated from your scroll position, so scrolling back up runs it exactly in reverse and the leaves return to their branches.":"Aşağı kaydırmak bir yılı akıtır: yaz, dönüm, sonbahar, alacakaranlık ve ardından kamera yer altına, köklere ve kapılara iner. Film oynatılmaz, kaydırmayla taranır. Her yaprağın uçuşu sizin kaydırma konumunuzdan hesaplanır; yukarı kaydırdığınızda tam tersine işler ve yapraklar dallarına döner.","Nothing in it depends on the clock except a light idle sway, which is the reason it can be run backwards at all.":"İçinde hafif bir salınım dışında saate bağlı hiçbir şey yok; zaten geriye sarılabilmesinin sebebi de bu.","The cover is not the whole map. Scroll up and the sky opens: clouds, a hot air balloon towing a banner, birds circling a thermal, and at night the stars. Drag sideways and the camera pans off the meadow. West lies Istanbul, with the Bosphorus, Kız Kulesi, a working ferry and the Beyazıt gate. East lies Munich, with the Alps, the Frauenkirche, the Eisbach and its surfer, a beer garden, the U-Bahn and TUM.":"Kapak haritanın tamamı değil. Yukarı kaydırın, gökyüzü açılır: bulutlar, arkasında pankart çeken bir sıcak hava balonu, termalde dönen kuşlar ve geceleri yıldızlar. Yana sürükleyin, kamera çayırdan çıkar. Batıda İstanbul: Boğaz, Kız Kulesi, çalışan bir vapur ve Beyazıt kapısı. Doğuda Münih: Alpler, Frauenkirche, Eisbach ve sörfçüsü, bir bira bahçesi, U-Bahn ve TUM.","Underground there is more than roots: a cellar, a well whose rope reaches the water table, an ant colony with branching galleries, a mole, a sleeping rabbit, a buried amphora, an aquifer with a blind fish in it, and a museum of thirteen objects in three bands, the deepest being the earliest.":"Yer altında köklerden fazlası var: bir kiler, halatı su tablasına ulaşan bir kuyu, dallanan galerileriyle bir karınca kolonisi, bir köstebek, uyuyan bir tavşan, gömülü bir amfora, içinde kör bir balık olan bir akifer ve üç kuşakta on üç nesnelik bir müze; en derindeki en eskisi.","Six things in the world are doors as well as scenery. The wooden sign on the pier in Istanbul, the U-Bahn stairs in Munich, the banner behind the balloon, the door of the house, a workbench with a saw leaning on it, and a game table with the stones of a game nobody finished still on the board.":"Bu dünyada altı şey aynı zamanda birer kapı. İstanbul'da iskeledeki ahşap tabela, Münih'te U-Bahn merdivenleri, balonun arkasındaki pankart, evin kapısı, üzerine testere dayanmış bir tezgâh ve kimsenin bitirmediği bir oyunun taşları hâlâ duran bir oyun masası.","One HTML file for the film. No framework, no images, no video, no tracking. The tree, the roots and the grass are grown by a seeded random walk, so the same tree comes back every time.":"Film için tek bir HTML dosyası. Çatı yok, görsel yok, video yok, takip yok. Ağaç, kökler ve çimen tohumlanmış bir rastgele yürüyüşle büyütülüyor; bu yüzden her seferinde aynı ağaç geliyor.","It ships through a seventeen gate release audit that blocks publication on a credential pattern, a personal data value, an untranslated key, a dictionary that is not symmetric across all three languages, or a number on the cover that no longer matches what the site actually holds.":"On yedi kapılı bir yayın denetiminden geçiyor; bir kimlik bilgisi kalıbı, bir kişisel veri değeri, çevrilmemiş bir anahtar, üç dilde simetrik olmayan bir sözlük ya da kapakta sitenin gerçekte tuttuğuyla artık uyuşmayan bir sayı yayını durduruyor.","Social media presence and brand identity for a B2B AI sales automation platform, alongside full time study.":"B2B yapay zekâ destekli satış otomasyonu platformu için sosyal medya varlığı ve marka kimliği; tam zamanlı öğrenimle birlikte yürütüldü.","A platform matching startup ideas with the talent to build them. Third at the Boğaziçi Enterprize competition, national level among JA Startup teams, semi final at YTU Entrepreneurship.":"Girişim fikirlerini onları kuracak yetenekle eşleştiren bir platform. Boğaziçi Enterprize yarışmasında üçüncülük, JA Startup takımları arasında ulusal düzey, YTÜ Girişimcilik'te yarı final.","A take back scheme and a product as a service model for industrial compressors, in a team of five. My part was the Scope 3 method and the reading of what ESPR and the Digital Product Passport would ask of it.":"Endüstriyel kompresörler için geri alma sistemi ve hizmet olarak ürün modeli; beş kişilik ekipte. Benim payıma Kapsam 3 yöntemi ve ESPR ile Dijital Ürün Pasaportu'nun bundan ne isteyeceğinin okuması düştü.","Market entry research in the team, and the client facing slides that went with it, charts included.":"Ekiple birlikte pazara giriş araştırması ve müşterinin önüne giden sunumlar, grafikleriyle birlikte.","Mapped and sized three B2B segments and wrote the market entry strategy underneath them, with KPIs and a risk assessment. Graded 1.0 by TUM, the top of the German scale.":"Üç B2B segmentini haritalayıp boyutlandırdım ve altlarına pazara giriş stratejisini yazdım; KPI'lar ve risk değerlendirmesiyle. TUM tarafından Alman ölçeğinin en üstü olan 1,0 ile notlandırıldı.","Went through the reporting obligations and separated the ones that applied to a controls manufacturer from the ones that did not.":"Raporlama yükümlülüklerini baştan sona geçtim ve bir kontrol sistemleri üreticisine uygulananları uygulanmayanlardan ayırdım.","Collected fuel and electricity data across the production sites and built a Scope 1 and Scope 2 inventory out of it.":"Üretim sahalarından yakıt ve elektrik verisini topladım ve bunlardan bir Kapsam 1 ve Kapsam 2 envanteri kurdum.","A hand drawn scroll film of one year in the life of a single tree, with a museum buried under its roots, Istanbul on one side and Munich on the other, and thirteen objects laid along the taproot in the order they happened. There are no images and no video in it. Everything, including the notebook that explains it, is drawn line by line while you watch.":"Tek bir ağacın bir yılını anlatan, elle çizilmiş kaydırmalı bir film; köklerinin altına gömülü bir müze, bir yanda İstanbul öbür yanda Münih ve ana kök boyunca olduğu sırayla dizilmiş on üç nesne. İçinde ne görsel var ne video. Onu açıklayan defter dahil her şey siz izlerken çizgi çizgi çiziliyor.","Running here":"Burada çalışıyor","Computed here":"Burada hesaplanıyor","Open full size":"Tam boy aç","This is the instrument itself, not a picture of it. Change anything in it and the figures below follow.":"Bu, enstrümanın resmi değil kendisi. İçinde bir şeyi değiştirin, aşağıdaki sayılar onu izler.","This is the exhibit itself, drawn from the figures the study uses.":"Bu, çalışmanın kullandığı sayılardan çizilmiş grafiğin kendisi.",Curated:"Derlenmiş","A to Z":"A'dan Z'ye","Most tested":"En çok test edilen",Sort:"Sırala",of:"/","Filter by name or what it does. Press / to jump here.":"Ada ya da ne yaptığına göre süzün. Buraya atlamak için / tuşuna basın.","Filter this list by name or by what it does":"Bu listeyi ada ya da ne yaptığına göre süzün","Nothing here matches":"Buna uyan bir şey yok:","Clear the field to see all":"Alanı temizleyin, tamamı görünsün:",Running:"Çalışıyor","A PDF imposed onto press sheets: saddle stitch, sewn signatures, n-up, cut and stack.":"Bir PDF'i baskı formalarına yerleştirir: tel dikiş, iplik dikiş, n-up, kes ve istifle.","A column of addresses onto Avery 5160 labels, positioned so the printer's own margin does not shift the grid.":"Bir adres sütununu Avery 5160 etiketlerine yerleştirir; yazıcının kendi kenar boşluğu ızgarayı kaydırmayacak şekilde konumlandırır.","A converter that names what is missing instead of guessing it.":"Eksik olanı tahmin etmek yerine adını koyan bir dönüştürücü.","A discounted cash flow where the terminal value is not allowed to hide.":"Nihai değerin saklanmasına izin verilmeyen bir indirgenmiş nakit akışı.","A feed that decides what each agent sees, run again against a neutral one on the same population.":"Her etmenin ne göreceğine karar veren bir akış; aynı popülasyon üzerinde nötr bir akışa karşı yeniden çalıştırılır.","A figure that carries its source, and keeps carrying it through the arithmetic.":"Kaynağını taşıyan ve onu hesap boyunca taşımayı sürdüren bir sayı.","A flooring take off walked wall by wall, with a check that catches a room whose walls do not close.":"Duvar duvar yürünen bir zemin metrajı; duvarları kapanmayan bir odayı yakalayan bir denetimle.","A guest list and a handful of rules onto tables, refusing the set of rules that cannot be satisfied.":"Bir davetli listesini ve birkaç kuralı masalara dağıtır; karşılanamayan kural kümesini reddeder.","A marginal abatement cost curve that will not abate more of a stream than the stream holds.":"Bir akımdan, o akımın tuttuğundan fazlasını azaltmayan bir marjinal azaltım maliyet eğrisi.","A reduction target is one number. The path to it is where the carbon actually goes.":"Bir azaltım hedefi tek bir sayıdır. Karbonun gerçekte nereye gittiği ise ona giden patikadadır.","A ring road with nothing blocking it. Set the density and the reaction time, tap one brake.":"Önünde hiçbir engel olmayan bir çevre yolu. Yoğunluğu ve tepki süresini ayarlayın, bir kez frene dokunun.","A runnable Schelling model. A mild individual preference turning into a segregated map.":"Çalıştırılabilir bir Schelling modeli. Hafif bir bireysel tercihin ayrışmış bir haritaya dönüşmesi.","A sandpile driven one grain at a time, organising itself to the edge of stability.":"Her seferinde tek bir tane atılarak sürülen, kendini kararlılığın sınırına örgütleyen bir kum yığını.","A single embedded emissions figure hides the one thing an abatement decision needs.":"Tek bir gömülü emisyon sayısı, bir azaltım kararının ihtiyaç duyduğu tek şeyi gizler.","A subtitle file against the reading speed and timing rules a broadcaster actually applies.":"Bir altyazı dosyasını, bir yayıncının gerçekte uyguladığı okuma hızı ve zamanlama kurallarına karşı sınar.","A table and a template in, a Word document out with each row filled in.":"İçeri bir tablo ve bir şablon, dışarı her satırı doldurulmuş bir Word belgesi.","A wall build up in, a U value out to ISO 6946, with the thermal bridging handled.":"İçeri bir duvar katmanlaması, dışarı ISO 6946'ya göre bir U değeri; ısı köprüleri hesaba katılmış.","Adverse selection, run as a used car market. Set the spread of quality and how much buyers can see.":"İkinci el otomobil piyasası olarak çalıştırılan ters seçim. Kalite dağılımını ve alıcıların ne kadarını görebildiğini ayarlayın.","An SVG into GRBL G code for a laser, inside shapes cut before the outline that would drop the part.":"Bir SVG'yi lazer için GRBL G koduna çevirir; parçayı düşürecek dış hattan önce iç şekilleri keser.","An abatement cost curve that prints the arithmetic behind every bar.":"Her çubuğun arkasındaki hesabı basan bir azaltım maliyet eğrisi.","Case study · one of eight":"Vaka çalışması · sekizden biri","Crossword grids filled from your own word list, with the symmetry and the interlock kept.":"Kendi kelime listenizden doldurulan bulmaca ızgaraları; simetri ve kenetlenme korunarak.","Drag the supply and demand curves, set a tax, and watch the burden split between the two sides.":"Arz ve talep eğrilerini sürükleyin, bir vergi koyun ve yükün iki taraf arasında nasıl bölündüğünü izleyin.","EBU R128 loudness on an audio file, and the single gain that hits the target without breaking the ceiling.":"Bir ses dosyasında EBU R128 gürlüğü ve tavanı aşmadan hedefi tutturan tek kazanç değeri.","Earthwork cut and fill between existing ground and a proposed level, with the section that can be checked by hand.":"Mevcut zemin ile önerilen kot arasında hafriyat kazı ve dolgusu; elle kontrol edilebilen kesitiyle.","Fairness as a force in real bargaining rather than a preference.":"Gerçek pazarlıkta bir tercih değil, bir kuvvet olarak adalet.","Four causes for one change in emissions, with nothing left over.":"Emisyonlardaki tek bir değişim için dört neden; artan hiçbir şey kalmadan.","Four measurements in, a skirt block drafted to that body and tiled onto A4.":"İçeri dört ölçü, dışarı o bedene göre çizilmiş ve A4'e döşenmiş bir etek kalıbı.","How deep you should reason about other people.":"Başkaları hakkında ne kadar derin akıl yürütmeniz gerektiği.","Matching Pennies":"Eşleşen Kuruşlar","Move the rate and watch a fixed benefit in a distant year lose almost all of its present value.":"Oranı değiştirin ve uzak bir yıldaki sabit bir faydanın bugünkü değerinin neredeyse tamamını nasıl yitirdiğini izleyin.","Names, roles and photographs onto ID cards, refusing every name the card cannot carry.":"Adları, unvanları ve fotoğrafları kimlik kartlarına yerleştirir; kartın taşıyamayacağı her adı reddeder.","Not here":"Burada değil","Parts onto boards in an order a panel saw can actually cut, rather than a nest it cannot.":"Parçaları, bir panel testerenin gerçekten kesebileceği bir sırayla levhalara yerleştirir; kesemeyeceği bir yerleşimle değil.","Sequential Code 128 barcode labels, with a check that they will actually scan at the size printed.":"Ardışık Code 128 barkod etiketleri; basıldıkları boyutta gerçekten okunacaklarına dair bir denetimle.","Six ways in":"İçeri altı yol","Sometimes the only unexploitable strategy is to be unpredictable.":"Bazen sömürülemeyen tek strateji öngörülemez olmaktır.","Text into Unified English Braille, with a back translator so the tables can be checked rather than trusted.":"Metni Unified English Braille'e çevirir; tabloların güvenilmek yerine denetlenebilmesi için bir geri çevirici ile.","The Beauty Contest":"Güzellik Yarışması","The Commons":"Müşterekler","The Long Game":"Uzun Oyun","The Stag Hunt":"Geyik Avı","The Ultimatum":"Ültimatom","The film, running":"Film, çalışıyor","The repeated prisoner's dilemma. Pick the strategies, set the payoffs and the chance the game continues.":"Yinelenen mahkûm ikilemi. Stratejileri seçin, getirileri ve oyunun sürme olasılığını ayarlayın.","The same contagion at the same transmission probability over a lattice, a small world and a scale free network.":"Aynı bulaşma, aynı geçiş olasılığıyla bir kafes, bir küçük dünya ve ölçekten bağımsız bir ağ üzerinde.","The tragedy as a result about rules rather than about people.":"Trajediyi insanlarla değil, kurallarla ilgili bir sonuç olarak.","The trap is not greed but doubt. Two equilibria, and only one of them is good.":"Tuzak açgözlülük değil, kuşkudur. İki denge var ve yalnızca biri iyi.","The world":"Dünya","This address does not match anything published on the site. Six ways back in, and what each one holds.":"Bu adres, sitede yayımlanmış hiçbir şeyle eşleşmiyor. İçeri dönmek için altı yol ve her birinin içinde ne olduğu.","Two sizings, the gap between them, and what each assumption would have to become.":"İki boyutlandırma, aralarındaki fark ve her varsayımın ne olması gerektiği.","What it does":"Ne yapıyor","What it is":"Ne olduğu","What it refuses to do":"Yapmayı reddettiği","Why a future changes the arithmetic of the present.":"Bir geleceğin bugünün hesabını neden değiştirdiği.",Problem:"Problem",Method:"Yöntem",Elsewhere:"Başka yerlerde",Close:"Kapanış",Based:"Konum",Language:"Dil",Jam:"Tıkanıklık",Pile:"Yığın",Diffusion:"Yayılım",Segregation:"Ayrışma",Recommender:"Öneri sistemi",Lemons:"Limonlar",Incidence:"Vergi yansıması",Discounting:"İskonto",Cooperation:"İşbirliği","It plays here, and it also":"Burada oynuyor, ayrıca","runs on its own":"kendi başına da çalışıyor",", in English, Turkish and German. The notebook at the bottom of the film explains every hidden thing in it. Nothing in there is a riddle: if something is listed, it happens.":", İngilizce, Türkçe ve Almanca. Filmin altındaki defter içindeki her gizli şeyi açıklar. Orada bilmece yoktur: bir şey yazıyorsa, olur.",Search:"Ara","Search everything":"Her şeyde ara","to move":"gezinmek için","to open":"açmak için","to close":"kapatmak için","Turkish native. English C1, IELTS":"Ana dil Türkçe. İngilizce C1, IELTS","German A2, self-assessed.":"Almanca A2, kendi değerlendirmem.","Student residence permit:":"Öğrenci oturma izni:","full days or":"tam gün ya da","half days a year under § 16b AufenthG, plus student assistant work at the university.":"yılda yarım gün, § 16b AufenthG kapsamında; ayrıca üniversitede öğrenci asistanlığı.","A cited emission factor that carries its source, and refuses a timestamp with no timezone on it.":"Kaynağını taşıyan, atıflı bir emisyon katsayısı; saat dilimi olmayan bir zaman damgasını reddeder.","A discounted cash flow that prints how much of its answer the perpetuity carries, and a market sized top down and bottom up side by side.":"Cevabının ne kadarını sonsuz büyüme varsayımının taşıdığını basan bir indirgenmiş nakit akışı ve yukarıdan aşağı ile aşağıdan yukarı yan yana boyutlandırılmış bir pazar.","A flooring quantity take off, walked wall by wall, with a check that catches a room whose walls do not close.":"Duvar duvar yürünen bir zemin metrajı; duvarları kapanmayan bir odayı yakalayan bir denetimle.","A platform matching startup ideas with the talent to build them. Third at the Boğaziçi Enterprize competition, national level among JA Startup teams, semi final at the Yıldız Technical University entrepreneurship competition.":"Girişim fikirlerini onları kuracak yetenekle eşleştiren bir platform. Boğaziçi Enterprize yarışmasında üçüncülük, JA Startup takımları arasında ulusal düzey, Yıldız Teknik Üniversitesi girişimcilik yarışmasında yarı final.","A research project I keep in the open.":"Açıkta yürüttüğüm bir araştırma projesi.","A wall construction in, a U value out to ISO 6946, with the thermal bridging handled.":"İçeri bir duvar kesiti, dışarı ISO 6946'ya göre bir U değeri; ısı köprüleri hesaba katılmış.","Available for working student and internship positions in Munich. I answer every message.":"Münih'te Werkstudent ve staj pozisyonlarına açığım. Her mesajı yanıtlarım.","Braille transcription, earthworks, press imposition, barcode labels and eleven more, in trades that have nothing to do with one another. 870 checks written by hand hold them up.":"Braille çevirisi, hafriyat, baskı forması, barkod etiketi ve on bir tane daha; birbiriyle hiç ilgisi olmayan mesleklerde. Elle yazılmış 870 kontrol onları ayakta tutuyor.","Built a product return scheme and a product as a service model for industrial compressors, in a team of five. My part was the Scope 3 method and the assessment of what the Ecodesign for Sustainable Products Regulation and the Digital Product Passport would require of it.":"Endüstriyel kompresörler için bir ürün geri alma sistemi ve hizmet olarak ürün modeli kurdum; beş kişilik ekipte. Benim payıma Kapsam 3 yöntemi ve Sürdürülebilir Ürünler için Ekotasarım Yönetmeliği ile Dijital Ürün Pasaportu'nun bundan ne isteyeceğinin değerlendirmesi düştü.","CBAM embedded emissions":"CBAM gömülü emisyonları","Case study · analyst-toolkit":"Vaka çalışması · analyst-toolkit","Case study · esg-toolkit":"Vaka çalışması · esg-toolkit","Case study · open-climate-data":"Vaka çalışması · open-climate-data","Case study · unitguard":"Vaka çalışması · unitguard","Data provenance":"Veri kökeni","Determinism does not buy you a forecast":"Determinizm size öngörü kazandırmaz","Discounted cash flow":"İndirgenmiş nakit akışı","Embedded emissions":"Gömülü emisyonlar","Emissions decomposition":"Emisyon ayrıştırması","Emissions traced back through a precursor chain, with the attribution reconciling exactly to the figure it explains.":"Öncül zinciri boyunca geriye izlenen emisyonlar; dağıtım, açıkladığı sayıya tam olarak denkleşiyor.","Every tool here is open and prints the arithmetic behind its answer. Three of them produce a figure that a professional would normally have to approve, and each of those three prints on its own result that the figure is not a guarantee.":"Buradaki her araç açıktır ve cevabının arkasındaki hesabı basar. Üçü, normalde bir uzmanın onaylaması gereken bir sayı üretir ve o üçünün her biri kendi sonucunun üzerine o sayının bir garanti olmadığını yazar.","If every decision is in principle knowable, is the financial future predictable? No, and the reason is structural.":"Her karar ilke olarak bilinebilirse, finansal gelecek öngörülebilir mi? Hayır, ve sebebi yapısal.","In closing":"Kapanış","Marginal abatement cost curve":"Marjinal azaltım maliyet eğrisi","Market sizing":"Pazar boyutlandırma","Ran the market entry research as part of the project team, and built the client facing slides that went with it, including the charts.":"Proje ekibinin bir parçası olarak pazara giriş araştırmasını yürüttüm ve müşterinin önüne giden sunumları grafikleriyle birlikte hazırladım.","Reduction pathway":"Azaltım patikası","Right to work":"Çalışma hakkı","The agent was never alone: SIMEA":"Etmen hiçbir zaman yalnız değildi: SIMEA","The same contagion at the same transmission probability, run over three network shapes: a lattice, a small world graph and a scale free graph.":"Aynı bulaşma, aynı geçiş olasılığıyla üç ağ biçimi üzerinde: bir kafes, bir küçük dünya çizgesi ve ölçekten bağımsız bir çizge.","Unit conversion":"Birim dönüşümü","Work you can check":"Kontrol edebileceğiniz iş","written by hand, not counted out of the code":"elle yazıldı, koddan sayılmadı","Sustainable Management and Technology at the Technical University of Munich, Economics at Istanbul University, studied in parallel. I have worked in ESG and consulting since 2024, in internships and in project work. I also build open source instruments for carbon accounting and financial analysis, and I publish each one with its method and its limits stated.":"Münih Teknik Üniversitesi'nde Sürdürülebilir Yönetim ve Teknoloji, İstanbul Üniversitesi'nde İktisat; paralel okunuyor. 2024'ten bu yana ESG ve danışmanlık alanında staj ve proje çalışmalarında çalıştım. Ayrıca karbon muhasebesi ve finansal analiz için açık kaynak araçlar yazıyorum ve her birini yöntemi ve sınırları yazılı olarak yayımlıyorum.","37 published pieces":"37 yayımlanmış parça","8 case studies":"8 vaka çalışması","The agent as a decision subject, embedded in systems that steer it, and what that does to the idea of a preference.":"Karar öznesi olarak etmen; onu yönlendiren sistemlerin içine gömülü, ve bunun tercih fikrine ne yaptığı.","Nothing publishes until a seventeen gate audit passes. The gates block a release that leaks a credential or a personal detail, that leaves a string untranslated, or that ships a dictionary missing an entry in one of the three languages. One gate checks the numbers on the cover against what the site actually holds.":"On yedi kapılı bir denetim geçmeden hiçbir şey yayımlanmıyor. Kapılar; bir kimlik bilgisini ya da kişisel bir ayrıntıyı sızdıran, bir metni çevrilmemiş bırakan ya da üç dilden birinde girdisi eksik bir sözlükle çıkan yayını durduruyor. Bir kapı da kapaktaki sayıları sitenin gerçekte tuttuğuyla karşılaştırıyor.","Skip to content":"İçeriğe atla","Filter these tools":"Bu araçları süz","Finished tools across unrelated trades, from braille transcription to earthworks, held up by 870 checks written by hand.":"Braille çevirisinden hafriyata, birbirinden uzak mesleklerde bitmiş araçlar; elle yazılmış 870 kontrolle ayakta.","Open source instruments for carbon accounting and financial analysis, each published with its method and its limits stated. Sustainability and economics studied in parallel, and ESG work since 2024.":"Karbon muhasebesi ve finansal analiz için açık kaynak enstrümanlar; her biri yöntemi ve sınırları yazılı olarak yayımlanmış. Sürdürülebilirlik ve iktisat paralel okunuyor, 2024'ten bu yana ESG işi.",Education:"Eğitim","live in this panel":"bu panelde çalışıyor","type in it":"içine yazın",checks:"kontrol",Location:"Konum",Open:"Aç","Show all":"Tümünü göster","The rest of it":"Geri kalanı","This is the instrument itself, not a picture of it. Change anything in it and it recomputes.":"Bu, enstrümanın resmi değil kendisi. İçinde bir şeyi değiştirin, yeniden hesaplar.","A hand drawn scroll film of one year in the life of a single tree. A museum sits under its roots, Istanbul on one side and Munich on the other. No images and no video: everything is drawn line by line while you watch.":"Tek bir ağacın bir yılını anlatan, elle çizilmiş kaydırmalı bir film. Köklerinin altında bir müze, bir yanda İstanbul öbür yanda Münih. Görsel yok, video yok: her şey siz izlerken çizgi çizgi çiziliyor.","Unified English Braille, with a back translator":"Unified English Braille, geri çeviriciyle","PDF imposition onto press sheets":"PDF'i baskı formalarına yerleştirme","Parts onto boards a panel saw can cut":"Panel testerenin kesebileceği levha yerleşimi","EBU R128 loudness and the gain that fits":"EBU R128 gürlüğü ve uyan kazanç","Earthwork cut and fill against a proposed level":"Önerilen kota göre hafriyat kazı ve dolgusu","Subtitles against broadcast reading speed":"Yayın okuma hızına karşı altyazılar","A skirt block drafted to four measurements":"Dört ölçüye göre çizilmiş etek kalıbı","Crossword grids from your own word list":"Kendi kelime listenizden bulmaca ızgaraları","A table and a template into a Word document":"Bir tablo ve bir şablondan Word belgesi","A wall build up in, a U value out to ISO 6946":"İçeri duvar kesiti, dışarı ISO 6946'ya göre U değeri","A flooring take off walked wall by wall":"Duvar duvar yürünen zemin metrajı","Names and photographs onto ID cards":"Adlar ve fotoğraflar kimlik kartlarına","A guest list and its rules onto tables":"Davetli listesi ve kuralları masalara","A marginal abatement cost curve":"Marjinal azaltım maliyet eğrisi","Addresses onto Avery 5160 labels":"Adresler Avery 5160 etiketlerine","Code 128 barcodes that actually scan":"Gerçekten okunan Code 128 barkodları","SVG into laser G code, inside cuts first":"SVG'den lazer G koduna, önce iç kesimler","Curriculum vitae":"Özgeçmiş","Download as PDF":"PDF olarak indir","2 notes":"2 not"},de:{Work:"Arbeiten","Life as a game":"Mein Leben als Spiel","Case studies":"Fallstudien",Notes:"Notizen",About:"Über mich",Contact:"Kontakt",Sections:"Bereiche","Open menu":"Menü öffnen","Close menu":"Menü schließen",Munich:"München",Email:"E-Mail",Privacy:"Datenschutz","Sustainability and economics, studied in parallel at the Technical University of Munich and Istanbul University. Internships and project work in ESG and consulting since 2024, and a body of open source instruments for carbon accounting and financial analysis, each published open with its method and its limits stated.":"Nachhaltigkeit und Volkswirtschaftslehre, parallel studiert an der Technischen Universität München und der Universität Istanbul. Seit 2024 Praktika und Projektarbeit in ESG und Beratung, dazu eine Reihe quelloffener Instrumente für CO2-Bilanzierung und Finanzanalyse, jedes mit offengelegter Methode und benannten Grenzen.","Munich, Germany":"München, Deutschland","Technical University of Munich and Istanbul University":"Technische Universität München und Universität Istanbul","Verified work":"Überprüfbare Arbeit","Every tool below is open and shows its working. Three produce a figure a professional signs off, and each states on the result that it does not guarantee it.":"Jedes Werkzeug unten ist offen und zeigt seinen Rechenweg. Drei liefern eine Zahl, die jemand unterschreibt, und jedes sagt auf dem Ergebnis selbst, dass es diese Zahl nicht garantiert.","test assertions":"Testprüfungen","worked by hand, not read back from the code":"von Hand geschrieben, nicht aus dem Code gezählt","finished tools":"fertige Werkzeuge","across trades with nothing in common":"in unverwandten Gewerken","case studies":"Fallstudien","method, assumptions and limits stated":"Methode, Annahmen und Grenzen benannt",instruments:"Instrumente","in the browser, no account required":"im Browser, ohne Konto","ESG and finance instruments":"ESG- und Finanzinstrumente","Seventeen finished tools":"Siebzehn fertige Werkzeuge","Finished tools across unrelated trades, from braille transcription to earthworks, held up by 870 hand worked test assertions.":"Fertige Werkzeuge in unverwandten Gewerken, von der Brailleübertragung bis zum Erdbau, getragen von 870 von Hand geschriebenen Testprüfungen.","My life as a game":"Mein Leben als Spiel","Play the film":"Film abspielen","What is inside it":"Was darin steckt","How it is built":"Wie es gebaut ist","Where it lives":"Wo es zu finden ist","Experience and education":"Erfahrung und Ausbildung","Seven roles across ESG, consulting, market entry and marketing, two degrees read in parallel, and the work permit.":"Sieben Stationen in ESG, Beratung, Markteintritt und Marketing, zwei parallel studierte Studiengänge und die Arbeitserlaubnis.","Eight written studies, each stating the problem, the method, and what the instrument refuses to do.":"Acht schriftliche Studien, jede mit Fragestellung, Methode und dem, was das Instrument ausdrücklich nicht leistet.","Available for working student and internship positions.":"Verfügbar für Werkstudenten- und Praktikumsstellen.","Whether an importer crosses the 50 tonne de minimis threshold, and what the certificates cost.":"Ob ein Importeur die 50-Tonnen-Geringfügigkeitsschwelle überschreitet und was die Zertifikate kosten.","Emissions traced through a precursor chain, the attribution reconciling to zero.":"Emissionen entlang einer Vorproduktkette verfolgt, die Zurechnung geht auf null auf.","A reduction target and the cumulative carbon budget it implies, not just its endpoint.":"Ein Minderungsziel und das kumulative CO2-Budget, das daraus folgt, nicht nur sein Endpunkt.","A cited emission factor that carries its source, and refuses a naive timestamp.":"Ein belegter Emissionsfaktor, der seine Quelle mitführt und einen naiven Zeitstempel verweigert.","A discounted cash flow that prints its terminal share, and a market sized both ways at once.":"Eine Discounted-Cashflow-Rechnung, die den Anteil des Endwerts ausweist, und eine Marktgröße, von beiden Seiten zugleich bestimmt.","CBAM screening, embedded emissions, reduction pathways, data provenance and valuation. Each runs in the browser and stores nothing.":"CBAM-Prüfung, graue Emissionen, Minderungspfade, Datenherkunft und Bewertung. Jedes läuft im Browser und speichert nichts.","Schelling segregation, network contagion, traffic jam formation, self organised criticality and recommender feedback.":"Schelling-Segregation, Ansteckung im Netzwerk, Stauentstehung, selbstorganisierte Kritikalität und Rückkopplung im Empfehlungssystem.","Adverse selection, tax incidence, discounting and repeated cooperation, each with a working model in the page.":"Adverse Selektion, Steuerinzidenz, Diskontierung und wiederholte Kooperation, jeweils mit einem lauffähigen Modell auf der Seite.","Six small games that are played rather than read.":"Sechs kleine Spiele, die gespielt und nicht gelesen werden.","Thirty seven published pieces":"Siebenunddreißig veröffentlichte Arbeiten","Everything here runs on this site. Nothing needs an account, nothing stores data, and every figure is checkable by opening the thing that produced it.":"Alles hier läuft auf dieser Seite. Nichts verlangt ein Konto, nichts speichert Daten, und jede Zahl lässt sich prüfen, indem man öffnet, was sie erzeugt hat.",pieces:"Arbeiten","Finished tools":"Fertige Werkzeuge","Agent based simulations":"Agentenbasierte Simulationen","Explorable essays":"Begehbare Essays","Game theory":"Spieltheorie","Seven roles, two degrees in progress":"Sieben Stationen, zwei laufende Studiengänge","Every role and every degree, in the order they happened, with the languages and the residence permit that frame where the work can happen.":"Jede Station und jedes Studium in der Reihenfolge, in der sie stattfanden, mit den Sprachen und der Aufenthaltserlaubnis, die den Rahmen setzen.",Experience:"Erfahrung","Education, languages, permit":"Ausbildung, Sprachen, Aufenthalt",Languages:"Sprachen","Work permit":"Arbeitserlaubnis","Available for working student and internship positions in Munich. Every message is read.":"Verfügbar für Werkstudenten- und Praktikumsstellen in München. Jede Nachricht wird gelesen.","Research notes on agency under algorithmic influence and on why a deterministic world still yields no forecast.":"Forschungsnotizen über Handlungsfähigkeit unter algorithmischem Einfluss und darüber, warum eine determinierte Welt dennoch keine Prognose hergibt.","Eight written case studies, each stating the problem, the method, and what the instrument refuses to do.":"Acht schriftliche Fallstudien, jede mit Fragestellung, Methode und dem, was das Instrument ausdrücklich nicht leistet.","Interactive · three languages":"Interaktiv · drei Sprachen","A hand drawn scroll film of one year in the life of a tree, with a museum buried under its roots and two cities either side. No images, no video: everything drawn line by line while you watch.":"Ein von Hand gezeichneter Scrollfilm über ein Jahr im Leben eines Baumes, mit einem Museum unter seinen Wurzeln und je einer Stadt zu beiden Seiten. Keine Bilder, kein Video: alles wird Strich für Strich gezeichnet, während man zusieht.","Scrolling down runs a year: summer, the turn, the fall, dusk, and then the camera goes underground to the roots and the doors. The film is scrubbed rather than played. Every leaf's flight is calculated from your scroll position, so scrolling back up runs it exactly in reverse and the leaves return to their branches.":"Nach unten scrollen lässt ein Jahr ablaufen: Sommer, die Wende, der Fall, die Dämmerung, und dann geht die Kamera unter die Erde zu den Wurzeln und den Türen. Der Film wird nicht abgespielt, sondern gescrubbt. Der Flug jedes Blattes wird aus Ihrer Scrollposition berechnet, sodass Zurückscrollen ihn exakt rückwärts laufen lässt und die Blätter an ihre Zweige zurückkehren.","Nothing in it depends on the clock except a light idle sway, which is the reason it can be run backwards at all.":"Nichts darin hängt an der Uhr außer einem leichten Wiegen im Leerlauf, und genau deshalb lässt es sich überhaupt rückwärts laufen.","The cover is not the whole map. Scroll up and the sky opens: clouds, a hot air balloon towing a banner, birds circling a thermal, and at night the stars. Drag sideways and the camera pans off the meadow. West lies Istanbul, with the Bosphorus, Kız Kulesi, a working ferry and the Beyazıt gate. East lies Munich, with the Alps, the Frauenkirche, the Eisbach and its surfer, a beer garden, the U-Bahn and TUM.":"Das Titelbild ist nicht die ganze Karte. Scrollen Sie nach oben, und der Himmel öffnet sich: Wolken, ein Heißluftballon mit einem Banner im Schlepp, Vögel, die in einer Thermik kreisen, und nachts die Sterne. Ziehen Sie zur Seite, und die Kamera schwenkt von der Wiese fort. Im Westen liegt Istanbul, mit dem Bosporus, dem Kız Kulesi, einer fahrenden Fähre und dem Beyazıt-Tor. Im Osten liegt München, mit den Alpen, der Frauenkirche, dem Eisbach und seinem Surfer, einem Biergarten, der U-Bahn und der TUM.","Underground there is more than roots: a cellar, a well whose rope reaches the water table, an ant colony with branching galleries, a mole, a sleeping rabbit, a buried amphora, an aquifer with a blind fish in it, and a museum of thirteen objects in three bands, the deepest being the earliest.":"Unter der Erde steckt mehr als Wurzeln: ein Keller, ein Brunnen, dessen Seil bis zum Grundwasser reicht, eine Ameisenkolonie mit verzweigten Gängen, ein Maulwurf, ein schlafendes Kaninchen, eine vergrabene Amphore, ein Grundwasserleiter mit einem blinden Fisch darin und ein Museum aus dreizehn Objekten in drei Schichten, das tiefste das früheste.","Six things in the world are doors as well as scenery. The wooden sign on the pier in Istanbul, the U-Bahn stairs in Munich, the banner behind the balloon, the door of the house, a workbench with a saw leaning on it, and a game table with the stones of a game nobody finished still on the board.":"Sechs Dinge in dieser Welt sind nicht nur Kulisse, sondern auch Türen. Das Holzschild am Anleger in Istanbul, die U-Bahn-Treppe in München, das Banner hinter dem Ballon, die Haustür, eine Werkbank mit angelehnter Säge und ein Spieltisch, auf dem die Steine einer nie beendeten Partie noch liegen.","One HTML file for the film. No framework, no images, no video, no tracking. The tree, the roots and the grass are grown by a seeded random walk, so the same tree comes back every time.":"Eine einzige HTML-Datei für den Film. Kein Framework, keine Bilder, kein Video, kein Tracking. Baum, Wurzeln und Gras wachsen aus einem gesäten Zufallslauf, sodass jedes Mal derselbe Baum entsteht.","It ships through a seventeen gate release audit that blocks publication on a credential pattern, a personal data value, an untranslated key, a dictionary that is not symmetric across all three languages, or a number on the cover that no longer matches what the site actually holds.":"Er geht durch eine Veröffentlichungsprüfung mit siebzehn Toren, die bei einem Zugangsdatenmuster, einem personenbezogenen Wert, einem unübersetzten Schlüssel, einem in den drei Sprachen nicht symmetrischen Wörterbuch oder einer Zahl auf dem Titel, die nicht mehr zum Inhalt passt, die Veröffentlichung stoppt.","Social media presence and brand identity for a B2B AI sales automation platform, alongside full time study.":"Social-Media-Präsenz und Markenauftritt für eine B2B-Plattform zur KI-gestützten Vertriebsautomatisierung, neben dem Vollzeitstudium.","A platform matching startup ideas with the talent to build them. Third at the Boğaziçi Enterprize competition, national level among JA Startup teams, semi final at YTU Entrepreneurship.":"Eine Plattform, die Gründungsideen mit den Leuten zusammenbringt, die sie bauen können. Dritter Platz beim Boğaziçi-Enterprize-Wettbewerb, nationale Ebene unter den JA-Startup-Teams, Halbfinale bei YTU Entrepreneurship.","A take back scheme and a product as a service model for industrial compressors, in a team of five. My part was the Scope 3 method and the reading of what ESPR and the Digital Product Passport would ask of it.":"Ein Rücknahmesystem und ein Product-as-a-Service-Modell für Industriekompressoren, im Fünferteam. Mein Teil war die Scope-3-Methode und die Lesart dessen, was ESPR und der Digitale Produktpass davon verlangen würden.","Market entry research in the team, and the client facing slides that went with it, charts included.":"Markteintrittsrecherche im Team und die Folien für den Kunden, samt Grafiken.","Mapped and sized three B2B segments and wrote the market entry strategy underneath them, with KPIs and a risk assessment. Graded 1.0 by TUM, the top of the German scale.":"Drei B2B-Segmente kartiert und dimensioniert und die Markteintrittsstrategie darunter geschrieben, mit KPIs und einer Risikobewertung. Von der TUM mit 1,0 bewertet, der Bestnote der deutschen Skala.","Went through the reporting obligations and separated the ones that applied to a controls manufacturer from the ones that did not.":"Die Berichtspflichten durchgegangen und die für einen Hersteller von Regelungstechnik einschlägigen von den nicht einschlägigen getrennt.","Collected fuel and electricity data across the production sites and built a Scope 1 and Scope 2 inventory out of it.":"Brennstoff- und Stromdaten über die Produktionsstandorte hinweg erhoben und daraus eine Scope-1- und Scope-2-Bilanz aufgebaut.","A hand drawn scroll film of one year in the life of a single tree, with a museum buried under its roots, Istanbul on one side and Munich on the other, and thirteen objects laid along the taproot in the order they happened. There are no images and no video in it. Everything, including the notebook that explains it, is drawn line by line while you watch.":"Ein von Hand gezeichneter Scrollfilm über ein Jahr im Leben eines einzelnen Baumes, mit einem Museum unter seinen Wurzeln, Istanbul auf der einen und München auf der anderen Seite und dreizehn Objekten, die entlang der Pfahlwurzel in der Reihenfolge liegen, in der sie geschahen. Es gibt darin keine Bilder und kein Video. Alles, auch das Notizbuch, das es erklärt, wird Strich für Strich gezeichnet, während man zusieht.","Running here":"Läuft hier","Computed here":"Wird hier berechnet","Open full size":"In voller Größe öffnen","This is the instrument itself, not a picture of it. Change anything in it and the figures below follow.":"Das ist das Instrument selbst, kein Bild davon. Ändern Sie etwas darin, und die Zahlen darunter folgen.","This is the exhibit itself, drawn from the figures the study uses.":"Das ist die Grafik selbst, gezeichnet aus den Zahlen, die die Studie verwendet.",Curated:"Kuratiert","A to Z":"A bis Z","Most tested":"Am meisten geprüft",Sort:"Sortierung",of:"von","Filter by name or what it does. Press / to jump here.":"Nach Name oder Funktion filtern. Mit / hierher springen.","Filter this list by name or by what it does":"Diese Liste nach Name oder Funktion filtern","Nothing here matches":"Dazu passt hier nichts:","Clear the field to see all":"Feld leeren, um alle zu sehen:",Running:"Läuft","A PDF imposed onto press sheets: saddle stitch, sewn signatures, n-up, cut and stack.":"Ein PDF auf Druckbogen ausgeschossen: Rückstichheftung, Fadenheftung, n-up, Schneiden und Stapeln.","A column of addresses onto Avery 5160 labels, positioned so the printer's own margin does not shift the grid.":"Eine Adressspalte auf Avery-5160-Etiketten, so positioniert, dass der Rand des Druckers das Raster nicht verschiebt.","A converter that names what is missing instead of guessing it.":"Ein Umrechner, der benennt, was fehlt, statt es zu raten.","A discounted cash flow where the terminal value is not allowed to hide.":"Eine Discounted-Cashflow-Rechnung, in der sich der Endwert nicht verstecken darf.","A feed that decides what each agent sees, run again against a neutral one on the same population.":"Ein Feed, der entscheidet, was jeder Agent sieht, erneut gegen einen neutralen Feed auf derselben Population laufen gelassen.","A figure that carries its source, and keeps carrying it through the arithmetic.":"Eine Zahl, die ihre Quelle mitführt und sie durch die ganze Rechnung weiterträgt.","A flooring take off walked wall by wall, with a check that catches a room whose walls do not close.":"Ein Bodenaufmaß, Wand für Wand abgegangen, mit einer Prüfung, die einen Raum erkennt, dessen Wände sich nicht schließen.","A guest list and a handful of rules onto tables, refusing the set of rules that cannot be satisfied.":"Eine Gästeliste und eine Handvoll Regeln auf Tische verteilt, wobei ein nicht erfüllbarer Regelsatz zurückgewiesen wird.","A marginal abatement cost curve that will not abate more of a stream than the stream holds.":"Eine Grenzvermeidungskostenkurve, die aus einem Strom nicht mehr vermeidet, als der Strom hergibt.","A reduction target is one number. The path to it is where the carbon actually goes.":"Ein Minderungsziel ist eine Zahl. Wo der Kohlenstoff tatsächlich hingeht, entscheidet der Pfad dorthin.","A ring road with nothing blocking it. Set the density and the reaction time, tap one brake.":"Eine Ringstraße, auf der nichts im Weg steht. Dichte und Reaktionszeit einstellen, einmal bremsen.","A runnable Schelling model. A mild individual preference turning into a segregated map.":"Ein lauffähiges Schelling-Modell. Eine milde individuelle Präferenz, die zu einer segregierten Karte wird.","A sandpile driven one grain at a time, organising itself to the edge of stability.":"Ein Sandhaufen, Korn für Korn getrieben, der sich selbst an den Rand der Stabilität organisiert.","A single embedded emissions figure hides the one thing an abatement decision needs.":"Eine einzelne Zahl für graue Emissionen verbirgt genau das, was eine Minderungsentscheidung braucht.","A subtitle file against the reading speed and timing rules a broadcaster actually applies.":"Eine Untertiteldatei gegen die Lesegeschwindigkeits- und Timingregeln geprüft, die ein Sender tatsächlich anwendet.","A table and a template in, a Word document out with each row filled in.":"Eine Tabelle und eine Vorlage hinein, ein Word-Dokument heraus, in dem jede Zeile ausgefüllt ist.","A wall build up in, a U value out to ISO 6946, with the thermal bridging handled.":"Ein Wandaufbau hinein, ein U-Wert nach ISO 6946 heraus, mit berücksichtigter Wärmebrücke.","Adverse selection, run as a used car market. Set the spread of quality and how much buyers can see.":"Adverse Selektion, als Gebrauchtwagenmarkt gespielt. Stellen Sie die Qualitätsstreuung ein und wie viel Käufer davon sehen.","An SVG into GRBL G code for a laser, inside shapes cut before the outline that would drop the part.":"Ein SVG in GRBL-G-Code für einen Laser, Innenkonturen vor der Außenkontur geschnitten, die das Teil fallen lassen würde.","An abatement cost curve that prints the arithmetic behind every bar.":"Eine Vermeidungskostenkurve, die die Rechnung hinter jedem Balken ausgibt.","Case study · one of eight":"Fallstudie · eine von acht","Crossword grids filled from your own word list, with the symmetry and the interlock kept.":"Kreuzworträtsel-Gitter, gefüllt aus Ihrer eigenen Wortliste, mit erhaltener Symmetrie und Verzahnung.","Drag the supply and demand curves, set a tax, and watch the burden split between the two sides.":"Ziehen Sie Angebots- und Nachfragekurve, setzen Sie eine Steuer und sehen Sie, wie sich die Last auf beide Seiten verteilt.","EBU R128 loudness on an audio file, and the single gain that hits the target without breaking the ceiling.":"EBU-R128-Lautheit einer Audiodatei und die eine Verstärkung, die das Ziel trifft, ohne die Grenze zu überschreiten.","Earthwork cut and fill between existing ground and a proposed level, with the section that can be checked by hand.":"Erdbau, Auf- und Abtrag zwischen vorhandenem Gelände und geplanter Höhe, mit dem von Hand prüfbaren Schnitt.","Fairness as a force in real bargaining rather than a preference.":"Fairness als Kraft in echten Verhandlungen, nicht als Präferenz.","Four causes for one change in emissions, with nothing left over.":"Vier Ursachen für eine Emissionsänderung, ohne Rest.","Four measurements in, a skirt block drafted to that body and tiled onto A4.":"Vier Maße hinein, ein auf diesen Körper konstruierter Rockgrundschnitt, auf A4 gekachelt.","How deep you should reason about other people.":"Wie tief man über andere nachdenken sollte.","Matching Pennies":"Matching Pennies","Move the rate and watch a fixed benefit in a distant year lose almost all of its present value.":"Verschieben Sie den Zinssatz und sehen Sie, wie ein fester Nutzen in ferner Zukunft fast seinen gesamten Barwert verliert.","Names, roles and photographs onto ID cards, refusing every name the card cannot carry.":"Namen, Funktionen und Fotos auf Ausweiskarten, wobei jeder Name zurückgewiesen wird, den die Karte nicht trägt.","Not here":"Nicht hier","Parts onto boards in an order a panel saw can actually cut, rather than a nest it cannot.":"Teile auf Platten in einer Reihenfolge, die eine Plattensäge tatsächlich schneiden kann, statt in einer Schachtelung, die sie nicht schafft.","Sequential Code 128 barcode labels, with a check that they will actually scan at the size printed.":"Fortlaufende Code-128-Barcodeetiketten, mit einer Prüfung, dass sie in der gedruckten Größe auch wirklich lesbar sind.","Six ways in":"Sechs Wege hinein","Sometimes the only unexploitable strategy is to be unpredictable.":"Manchmal ist die einzige nicht ausnutzbare Strategie, unberechenbar zu sein.","Text into Unified English Braille, with a back translator so the tables can be checked rather than trusted.":"Text in Unified English Braille, mit einem Rückübersetzer, damit die Tabellen geprüft und nicht geglaubt werden müssen.","The Beauty Contest":"Der Schönheitswettbewerb","The Commons":"Die Allmende","The Long Game":"Das lange Spiel","The Stag Hunt":"Die Hirschjagd","The Ultimatum":"Das Ultimatum","The film, running":"Der Film, laufend","The repeated prisoner's dilemma. Pick the strategies, set the payoffs and the chance the game continues.":"Das wiederholte Gefangenendilemma. Wählen Sie die Strategien, setzen Sie die Auszahlungen und die Fortsetzungswahrscheinlichkeit.","The same contagion at the same transmission probability over a lattice, a small world and a scale free network.":"Dieselbe Ansteckung bei gleicher Übertragungswahrscheinlichkeit über ein Gitter, ein Kleine-Welt- und ein skalenfreies Netzwerk.","The tragedy as a result about rules rather than about people.":"Die Tragödie als Ergebnis über Regeln, nicht über Menschen.","The trap is not greed but doubt. Two equilibria, and only one of them is good.":"Die Falle ist nicht Gier, sondern Zweifel. Zwei Gleichgewichte, und nur eines davon ist gut.","The world":"Die Welt","This address does not match anything published on the site. Six ways back in, and what each one holds.":"Diese Adresse passt zu nichts, was auf der Seite veröffentlicht ist. Sechs Wege zurück, und was auf jedem davon liegt.","Two sizings, the gap between them, and what each assumption would have to become.":"Zwei Marktgrößen, die Lücke dazwischen und was aus jeder Annahme werden müsste.","What it does":"Was es leistet","What it is":"Was es ist","What it refuses to do":"Was es ausdrücklich nicht leistet","Why a future changes the arithmetic of the present.":"Warum eine Zukunft die Rechnung der Gegenwart verändert.",Problem:"Fragestellung",Method:"Methode",Elsewhere:"Anderswo",Close:"Schluss",Based:"Standort",Language:"Sprache",Jam:"Stau",Pile:"Haufen",Diffusion:"Diffusion",Segregation:"Segregation",Recommender:"Empfehlungssystem",Lemons:"Zitronen",Incidence:"Steuerinzidenz",Discounting:"Diskontierung",Cooperation:"Kooperation","It plays here, and it also":"Er läuft hier, und er","runs on its own":"läuft auch für sich allein",", in English, Turkish and German. The notebook at the bottom of the film explains every hidden thing in it. Nothing in there is a riddle: if something is listed, it happens.":", auf Englisch, Türkisch und Deutsch. Das Notizbuch am Fuß des Films erklärt jede verborgene Sache darin. Nichts davon ist ein Rätsel: was dort steht, geschieht auch.",Search:"Suchen","Search everything":"Alles durchsuchen","to move":"zum Blättern","to open":"zum Öffnen","to close":"zum Schließen","Turkish native. English C1, IELTS":"Türkisch Muttersprache. Englisch C1, IELTS","German A2, self-assessed.":"Deutsch A2, Selbsteinschätzung.","Student residence permit:":"Studentische Aufenthaltserlaubnis:","full days or":"volle Tage oder","half days a year under § 16b AufenthG, plus student assistant work at the university.":"halbe Tage im Jahr nach § 16b AufenthG, dazu studentische Hilfskrafttätigkeit an der Universität.","A cited emission factor that carries its source, and refuses a timestamp with no timezone on it.":"Ein belegter Emissionsfaktor, der seine Quelle mitführt und einen Zeitstempel ohne Zeitzone verweigert.","A discounted cash flow that prints how much of its answer the perpetuity carries, and a market sized top down and bottom up side by side.":"Eine Discounted-Cashflow-Rechnung, die ausweist, wie viel ihres Ergebnisses die ewige Rente trägt, und eine Marktgröße, top down und bottom up nebeneinander.","A flooring quantity take off, walked wall by wall, with a check that catches a room whose walls do not close.":"Ein Bodenmengenaufmaß, Wand für Wand abgegangen, mit einer Prüfung, die einen Raum erkennt, dessen Wände sich nicht schließen.","A platform matching startup ideas with the talent to build them. Third at the Boğaziçi Enterprize competition, national level among JA Startup teams, semi final at the Yıldız Technical University entrepreneurship competition.":"Eine Plattform, die Gründungsideen mit den Leuten zusammenbringt, die sie bauen können. Dritter Platz beim Boğaziçi-Enterprize-Wettbewerb, nationale Ebene unter den JA-Startup-Teams, Halbfinale beim Gründungswettbewerb der Yıldız Technical University.","A research project I keep in the open.":"Ein Forschungsprojekt, das ich offen führe.","A wall construction in, a U value out to ISO 6946, with the thermal bridging handled.":"Ein Wandaufbau hinein, ein U-Wert nach ISO 6946 heraus, mit berücksichtigter Wärmebrücke.","Available for working student and internship positions in Munich. I answer every message.":"Verfügbar für Werkstudenten- und Praktikumsstellen in München. Ich beantworte jede Nachricht.","Braille transcription, earthworks, press imposition, barcode labels and eleven more, in trades that have nothing to do with one another. 870 checks written by hand hold them up.":"Brailleübertragung, Erdbau, Druckbogenausschießen, Barcodeetiketten und elf weitere, in Gewerken, die nichts miteinander zu tun haben. 870 von Hand geschriebene Prüfungen tragen sie.","Built a product return scheme and a product as a service model for industrial compressors, in a team of five. My part was the Scope 3 method and the assessment of what the Ecodesign for Sustainable Products Regulation and the Digital Product Passport would require of it.":"Ein Produktrücknahmesystem und ein Product-as-a-Service-Modell für Industriekompressoren aufgebaut, im Fünferteam. Mein Teil war die Scope-3-Methode und die Einschätzung dessen, was die Ökodesign-Verordnung für nachhaltige Produkte und der Digitale Produktpass davon verlangen würden.","CBAM embedded emissions":"CBAM graue Emissionen","Case study · analyst-toolkit":"Fallstudie · analyst-toolkit","Case study · esg-toolkit":"Fallstudie · esg-toolkit","Case study · open-climate-data":"Fallstudie · open-climate-data","Case study · unitguard":"Fallstudie · unitguard","Data provenance":"Datenherkunft","Determinism does not buy you a forecast":"Determinismus verschafft Ihnen keine Prognose","Discounted cash flow":"Discounted Cashflow","Embedded emissions":"Graue Emissionen","Emissions decomposition":"Emissionszerlegung","Emissions traced back through a precursor chain, with the attribution reconciling exactly to the figure it explains.":"Emissionen entlang einer Vorproduktkette zurückverfolgt, wobei die Zurechnung exakt auf die Zahl aufgeht, die sie erklärt.","Every tool here is open and prints the arithmetic behind its answer. Three of them produce a figure that a professional would normally have to approve, and each of those three prints on its own result that the figure is not a guarantee.":"Jedes Werkzeug hier ist offen und gibt die Rechnung hinter seiner Antwort aus. Drei davon liefern eine Zahl, die normalerweise jemand fachlich freigeben müsste, und jedes dieser drei schreibt auf sein eigenes Ergebnis, dass die Zahl keine Garantie ist.","If every decision is in principle knowable, is the financial future predictable? No, and the reason is structural.":"Wenn jede Entscheidung im Prinzip erkennbar ist, ist die finanzielle Zukunft dann vorhersagbar? Nein, und der Grund ist struktureller Art.","In closing":"Zum Schluss","Marginal abatement cost curve":"Grenzvermeidungskostenkurve","Market sizing":"Marktgrößenbestimmung","Ran the market entry research as part of the project team, and built the client facing slides that went with it, including the charts.":"Die Markteintrittsrecherche als Teil des Projektteams geführt und die Folien für den Kunden samt Grafiken erstellt.","Reduction pathway":"Minderungspfad","Right to work":"Recht zu arbeiten","The agent was never alone: SIMEA":"Der Agent war nie allein: SIMEA","The same contagion at the same transmission probability, run over three network shapes: a lattice, a small world graph and a scale free graph.":"Dieselbe Ansteckung bei gleicher Übertragungswahrscheinlichkeit, über drei Netzwerkformen laufen gelassen: ein Gitter, ein Kleine-Welt-Graph und ein skalenfreier Graph.","Unit conversion":"Einheitenumrechnung","Work you can check":"Arbeit, die Sie prüfen können","written by hand, not counted out of the code":"von Hand geschrieben, nicht aus dem Code gezählt","Sustainable Management and Technology at the Technical University of Munich, Economics at Istanbul University, studied in parallel. I have worked in ESG and consulting since 2024, in internships and in project work. I also build open source instruments for carbon accounting and financial analysis, and I publish each one with its method and its limits stated.":"Sustainable Management and Technology an der Technischen Universität München, Volkswirtschaftslehre an der Universität Istanbul, parallel studiert. Seit 2024 arbeite ich in ESG und Beratung, in Praktika und in Projektarbeit. Außerdem baue ich quelloffene Instrumente für CO2-Bilanzierung und Finanzanalyse und veröffentliche jedes mit seiner Methode und seinen Grenzen.","37 published pieces":"37 veröffentlichte Arbeiten","8 case studies":"8 Fallstudien","The agent as a decision subject, embedded in systems that steer it, and what that does to the idea of a preference.":"Der Agent als Entscheidungssubjekt, eingebettet in Systeme, die ihn lenken, und was das mit dem Begriff der Präferenz macht.","Nothing publishes until a seventeen gate audit passes. The gates block a release that leaks a credential or a personal detail, that leaves a string untranslated, or that ships a dictionary missing an entry in one of the three languages. One gate checks the numbers on the cover against what the site actually holds.":"Nichts wird veröffentlicht, bevor eine Prüfung mit siebzehn Toren bestanden ist. Die Tore stoppen eine Veröffentlichung, die ein Zugangsdatum oder ein persönliches Detail preisgibt, die eine Zeichenkette unübersetzt lässt oder die ein Wörterbuch ausliefert, dem in einer der drei Sprachen ein Eintrag fehlt. Ein Tor prüft die Zahlen auf dem Titel gegen das, was die Seite tatsächlich enthält.","Skip to content":"Zum Inhalt springen","Filter these tools":"Diese Werkzeuge filtern","Finished tools across unrelated trades, from braille transcription to earthworks, held up by 870 checks written by hand.":"Fertige Werkzeuge in unverwandten Gewerken, von der Brailleübertragung bis zum Erdbau, getragen von 870 von Hand geschriebenen Prüfungen.","Open source instruments for carbon accounting and financial analysis, each published with its method and its limits stated. Sustainability and economics studied in parallel, and ESG work since 2024.":"Quelloffene Instrumente für CO2-Bilanzierung und Finanzanalyse, jedes mit offengelegter Methode und benannten Grenzen. Nachhaltigkeit und Volkswirtschaftslehre parallel studiert, ESG-Arbeit seit 2024.",Education:"Ausbildung","live in this panel":"läuft in diesem Feld","type in it":"hineinschreiben",checks:"Prüfungen",Location:"Standort",Open:"Öffnen","Show all":"Alle anzeigen","The rest of it":"Der Rest davon","This is the instrument itself, not a picture of it. Change anything in it and it recomputes.":"Das ist das Instrument selbst, kein Bild davon. Ändern Sie etwas darin, und es rechnet neu.","A hand drawn scroll film of one year in the life of a single tree. A museum sits under its roots, Istanbul on one side and Munich on the other. No images and no video: everything is drawn line by line while you watch.":"Ein von Hand gezeichneter Scrollfilm über ein Jahr im Leben eines einzelnen Baumes. Unter seinen Wurzeln liegt ein Museum, auf der einen Seite Istanbul, auf der anderen München. Keine Bilder und kein Video: alles wird Strich für Strich gezeichnet, während man zusieht.","Unified English Braille, with a back translator":"Unified English Braille, mit Rückübersetzer","PDF imposition onto press sheets":"PDF-Ausschießen auf Druckbogen","Parts onto boards a panel saw can cut":"Teile auf Platten, die eine Plattensäge schneiden kann","EBU R128 loudness and the gain that fits":"EBU-R128-Lautheit und die passende Verstärkung","Earthwork cut and fill against a proposed level":"Erdbau, Auf- und Abtrag gegen eine geplante Höhe","Subtitles against broadcast reading speed":"Untertitel gegen die Lesegeschwindigkeit im Rundfunk","A skirt block drafted to four measurements":"Ein Rockgrundschnitt nach vier Maßen","Crossword grids from your own word list":"Kreuzworträtsel-Gitter aus Ihrer eigenen Wortliste","A table and a template into a Word document":"Eine Tabelle und eine Vorlage in ein Word-Dokument","A wall build up in, a U value out to ISO 6946":"Ein Wandaufbau hinein, ein U-Wert nach ISO 6946 heraus","A flooring take off walked wall by wall":"Ein Bodenaufmaß, Wand für Wand abgegangen","Names and photographs onto ID cards":"Namen und Fotos auf Ausweiskarten","A guest list and its rules onto tables":"Eine Gästeliste und ihre Regeln auf Tische","A marginal abatement cost curve":"Eine Grenzvermeidungskostenkurve","Addresses onto Avery 5160 labels":"Adressen auf Avery-5160-Etiketten","Code 128 barcodes that actually scan":"Code-128-Barcodes, die auch gelesen werden","SVG into laser G code, inside cuts first":"SVG in Laser-G-Code, Innenschnitte zuerst","Curriculum vitae":"Lebenslauf","Download as PDF":"Als PDF herunterladen","2 notes":"2 Notizen"}},t=(0,a.createContext)({lang:"en",setLang:()=>{},t:e=>e}),r="lang";function s(){return(0,a.useContext)(t)}e.s(["LANGS",0,[{code:"en",label:"EN",name:"English"},{code:"tr",label:"TR",name:"Türkçe"},{code:"de",label:"DE",name:"Deutsch"}],"LangProvider",0,function({children:e}){let[s,l]=(0,a.useState)("en");(0,a.useEffect)(()=>{let e=null;try{e=window.localStorage.getItem(r)}catch{}("tr"===e||"de"===e)&&l(e)},[]),(0,a.useEffect)(()=>{document.documentElement.lang=s},[s]);let o=(0,a.useCallback)(e=>{l(e);try{window.localStorage.setItem(r,e)}catch{}},[]),d=(0,a.useCallback)(e=>"en"===s?e:i[s][e.replace(/\s+/g," ").trim()]??e,[s]);return(0,n.jsx)(t.Provider,{value:{lang:s,setLang:o,t:d},children:e})},"T",0,function({children:e}){let{t:a}=s();return(0,n.jsx)(n.Fragment,{children:a(e)})},"useLang",0,s],33499)}]);